     A* ======================================================================
     A* MENUDSPF - Main menu screen
     A* Author: Arnav    Created: 2026-10-06
     A*
     A* Indicator map:
     A*   03     F3 = Exit
     A*   50     Option field in error (reverse image + cursor there)
     A*   98     Message subfile end marker ('+' when more messages)
     A*
     A* Message subfile (MSGSFL + MSGCTL): shows the messages that
     A* COMUTIL's SendMsg puts in MENUPGM's own message queue, on line 24.
     A* PGMQ is set by MENUPGM to its own name; SendMsg uses the same.
     A* Write MSGCTL first, then EXFMT MENU; OVERLAY on both so neither
     A* erases the other.
     A*
     A* Change log:
     A*   2026-10-06  Arnav  Created (Sprint 2, checkpoint 2B)
     A*   2026-10-09  Arnav  Option 4 Order Inquiry (Sprint 4, 4C)
     A* ======================================================================
     A                                      DSPSIZ(24 80 *DS3)
     A                                      CA03(03 'F3=Exit')
     A*
     A* Main screen
     A          R MENU                      OVERLAY
     A                                  1  2'MENU'
     A                                  1 26'RETAIL ORDER ENTRY - MAIN MENU'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  1 72DATE EDTCDE(Y)
     A                                  2 71USER
     A                                  5  9'1. Customer Maintenance'
     A                                  6  9'2. Item Maintenance'
     A                                  7  9'3. Order Maintenance'
     A                                  8  9'4. Order Inquiry (SQL)'
     A                                 10  9'Option:'
     A* 1A, not numeric: a letter reaches the program, which answers
     A* with our COM0001 instead of a system error.
     A            OPTION         1A  B 10 17
     A  50                                  DSPATR(RI PC)
     A N50                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A                                 23  2'F3=Exit'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A*
     A* Message subfile: one row per message, shown on line 24
     A          R MSGSFL                    SFL
     A                                      SFLMSGRCD(24)
     A            MSGKEY                    SFLMSGKEY
     A            PGMQ                      SFLPGMQ(10)
     A*
     A* Message subfile control: SFLINZ loads it from the queue named
     A* in PGMQ every time this record is written.
     A          R MSGCTL                    SFLCTL(MSGSFL)
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                      SFLDSP
     A                                      SFLDSPCTL
     A                                      SFLINZ
     A* SFLEND must be conditioned; 98 is set on once by the program.
     A  98                                  SFLEND
     A                                      SFLSIZ(0002)
     A                                      SFLPAG(0001)
     A            PGMQ                      SFLPGMQ(10)
